<title>UK: Germany to lift oil Monday, sell 10 days later.</title>
<headline>Germany to lift oil Monday, sell 10 days later.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany will start removing strategic oil reserves from underground salt caverns on Monday and will be ready to sell the first tranche 10 days later, industry sources said on Friday.</p>
<p>The sale of the government's strategic crude oil reserves, aimed at helping cut the budget deficit to qualify for Europe's single currency, will be organised by the Hamburg-based agency EBV, they said.</p>
